This project is a Rust/PyO3 port of the ROS (Regression on Order Statistics)
and bootstrap routines from wqio (https://github.com/jakevwout/wqio), which is
also MIT licensed. The wqio sources vendored under `wqio/` are unmodified apart
from the removal of modules this project does not use, and remain the copyright
of their authors. See https://github.com/jakevwout/wqio/blob/master/LICENSE for
the upstream license text.
